==Overview==
The '''Turkey Toilet''' is an enemy that appears in [[Abysmal Mode (Thanksgiving Event)|Abysmal Mode]].

This enemy appears a lot through [[Abysmal Mode (Thanksgiving Event)|Abysmal Mode]] from Wave 5 and above all the way until Wave 46 when they stop appearing.

== Appearance ==
The Turkey Toilet looks like a toilet that has a turkey head in it.

== Waves ==

=== Abysmal Mode ===

* Wave 5: ??? HP x1
== Strategy ==
* The Turkey Toilet is easy to defeat. If you cannot defeat it, you can let it leak as it does not do much damage to your base.
== Trivia ==

* This enemy was added in the thanksgiving event as a special toilet
* This enemy is the first out of the two toilets with a turkey head. 
